// IntroString :
"P1725122956" "I just received an anonymous tip that the Council is still investigating World War II history. Seems there's a warehouse in this city that has a bunch of old FBI files on civil and military leaders and heroes from the 1940's. The government hasn't touched the place in decades, but it sounds like the Council is eager to rummage through it now. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you stop the Council from getting those files?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2809371422" "Stop the Council from getting the files"
// SendOffString :
"P3723851857" "The Council has been really focused on the past recently, and we still don't have a clue why."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P124513975" "Defeat all Council agents"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1892899869" "Whatever the Council wants with those records, it can't be good. Stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3341996452" "Dusty file cabinets stand against the wall, their contents ripped out and scattered on the floor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
