// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2448252707" "There are numerous files here detailing Council activity. Interesting, but not what you're looking for. You take them and move on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DummyFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1882204048" "There's nothing of immediate use in these files. You leave them for now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3713654742" "You discovered Ubelmann's location and found a clue to his real origins."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2118915902" "All the interest in the Second World War, the way he acted like he knew 'Thunderhead' Bartlett, the tech thefts, and the mention of his name in that book. I hate to think it, I hate to say it, but it would explain so much. Wolfgang Ubelmann may be a time traveler from the 1940's. A man from the past sent to observe the future. With the information he now has, he could change his future, our present. I'm sure you know that the Council's roots lie with Mussolini's government. If the war had turned out differently, who knows how much power they could wield today?  <br><br>It explains everything. Everything, that is, except why that Council informant is trying to help us stop him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2187025375" "Whoever Ubelmann is or whenever he's from, our inside informant has given us a good shot at catching him. Apparently the Council has been stockpiling parts for a time machine to send Ubelmann back to the past. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I still don't know if I believe that Wolfgang Ubelmann is a time traveler from the Second World War, but we should stop the construction of that device.</a> We can't take the chance that it might work."
// AcceptString :
"P40601746" "Stop the construction of the device"
// SendOffString :
"P282866263" "As far as I know, Paolo Tirelli formed the Council during the final days of World War II, when Mussolini's government was crumbling around him. If he was truly involved in Ubelmann's journey to our time, however, he had a lot of power even before he made himself known as the Center. And this plot of his has been generations in the making!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1590721130" "Stop building of time machine"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P875322949" "If you can get your hands on those parts, the Council won't be able to complete their time machine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4082519393" "The idea of changing the past is one that has long tempted the world's greatest temporal physicists. Most of the sane ones have learned to let it go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3187408870" "It all seems unreal. I still don't know if I believe Ubelmann's story."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2394780546" "I wonder what will happen to us if Ubelmann succeeds? Will we still exist?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4274273854" "Enough talk. Heroes! Counter attack pattern Delta!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ClueCrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// Description :
"P2878120238" "parts to secure"
// SingularDescription :
"P317503473" "Secure the last batch of parts!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2687976334" "You begin searching the crate."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3854780254" "You finish searching the crate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3006594085" "You secured the parts and found some orders signed by Ubelmann."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ExperimentLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2252109470" "You have secured the parts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4102319613" "You prevented the Council from building a time machine and found a clue to Ubelmann's location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3805930713" "You prevented the Council from constructing that crazy time machine, but there's one last thing to do. You've got to capture Ubelmann and put an end to this. If he does have a way back to the 1940s with enough information to change history, then he has to be stopped. The Center has had more than half a century to plot out exactly how his younger self can wrest control of the world from his masters. I don't even want to think about what will happen if Ubelmann succeeds."
// RandomFameString :
"P980656986" "I hear that {HeroName} is on the verge of a breakthrough against the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P306455544" "The orders you found in that Council base told us exactly where to find Wolfgang Ubelmann. Now you just have to catch him. According to those orders, the Council plans to modify the machinery in a Portal Corporation lab to make a one-way time gate and return Ubelmann to the past. We can't let that happen. This is the last chance we have to end this. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can stop Wolfgang Ubelmann, then this is over.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P4130645325" "Stop Wolfgang Ubelmann"
// SendOffString :
"P4173861612" "Take out Ubelmann, and we're home free."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4138996135" "Defeat Ubelmann and his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3050528421" "You've got to stop Wolfgang Ubelmann before he can escape back to wherever or whenever he came from."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1780990380" "As far as you're concerned, neither past nor present is safe as long as Ubelmann remains free."

