"P45774200" "They're talking about some kind of time travel. But that's not possible!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P922966544" "That Ubelmann's a madman! He'll endanger us all with his modifications!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3894026737" "They've done so much damage already! You've got to stop them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P381390638" "You have defeated Wolfgang Ubelmann, the man from the past."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3909444234" "Ubelmann is recuperating from the battle, but the prison doctors say his recovery will be short lived at best. It seems that he'd already suffered a massive radiation overdose during his trip through time. The doctors give him a year at the outside.<br><br>It's ironic. Even if Ubelmann had made it back to the past, he never would have lived to see the future.<br><br>This letter came. I haven't opened it, but it's addressed to you from Requiem. The Requiem. The villain from the 40's, the one who led the original regime that was subsumed by the Council. I don't know if it's real. I really hope that it's not. But old evils like him seldom just disappear."
// RandomFameString :
"P3646742130" "{HeroName} just stopped some big Council plan. I wonder what it was all about?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3192217444" "You did well, {HeroName}. Generations yet to come owe you their thanks."
// RandomFameString :
"P3667001237" "Did you know (HeroName) stopped a time traveler from destroying the world as we know it? It's true; I swear!"
